# Project context

- Read `docs/cursor-knowledge.md` and `AGENTS.md` before non-trivial edits.
- Trust `routes/api/v1/*.php` and `tests/Feature` over `app-plan.md` and PHASE trackers.
- Controllers stay thin; business logic belongs in `app/Services`.
- Public API IDs are UUIDs, not numeric primary keys.
- Do not implement OTP, Socialite login, or Razorpay checkout/webhooks unless the user asks. They are not in the codebase.
- Never commit `.env` or `storage/app/firebase/*.json`.
